@page
@model AiSummariesModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "AI-generated summaries and the data they use";
}

@section BeforeMain {
    <govuk-back-link href="@Url.BackLink(Url.Page("/Index"))">Back</govuk-back-link>
}

<h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">AI-generated summaries and the data they use</h1>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">How a summary is generated</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">
    When you search for a school or trust, the service finds the records DfE holds about it. AI then reads those
    records and writes a short summary.
</p>
<p class="govuk-body">
    The AI only uses the records it finds for that school or trust. Each fact in the summary links to the record
    it came from, listed under References at the end of the summary.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">The data it uses</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">A summary can include:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>establishment details, such as type, phase, age range, local authority, trust, capacity and number on roll</li>
    <li>trust details, its governance and the academies in the trust</li>
    <li>Ofsted inspection outcomes</li>
    <li>KS2 and KS4 attainment, alongside local and national averages</li>
    <li>attendance</li>
    <li>socio-economic figures, such as free school meals, SEN support and EHCPs</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">If a record isn't held for a school or trust, that part of the summary is left out.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Information from the web</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">
    After a summary is generated, you can choose to search the web. This looks for education-related news about
    the school or trust from the last two years, from sources such as the local authority, local news and GOV.UK.
    What it finds is added in a "More background information" section, with a link to each source. The web is
    only searched if you choose it.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Checking a summary</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">AI can make mistakes. A summary may:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>leave out information</li>
    <li>describe information wrongly</li>
    <li>use records that are out of date</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">
    Use the summary as a starting point. Check important information against the source data before using it in
    a briefing or decision, and follow departmental guidance on the use of AI-generated content.
</p>

<govuk-button-link href="@Url.Page("/Briefing/Type")">Generate a summary</govuk-button-link>
